@startuml View变量处理流程序列图

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

title Datart View 变量处理流程序列图

actor 用户 as User
participant "控制器\nViewController" as VC
participant "数据服务\nDataProviderService" as DPS
participant "变量服务\nVariableService" as VS
participant "变量替换\nVariablePlaceholder" as VP
participant "SQL渲染\nSqlScriptRender" as SR
database "数据库" as DB

== 变量配置流程 ==

User -> VC: 创建/编辑View\n(包含变量配置)
activate VC

VC -> VS: batchInsert(variablesToCreate)
activate VS

VS -> VS: checkUnique(orgId, viewId, name)
note right: 检查变量名唯一性

VS -> DB: INSERT INTO variable
DB --> VS: success

alt 包含权限变量值配置
    VS -> DB: INSERT INTO rel_variable_subject
    note right
        配置不同角色的变量值
        roleA → ["华东", "华南"]
        roleB → ["华北"]
    end note
end

VS --> VC: List<Variable>
deactivate VS

VC --> User: 保存成功
deactivate VC

== 查询执行流程 (变量解析) ==

User -> DPS: execute(ViewExecuteParam)
activate DPS

note over DPS
    ViewExecuteParam包含:
    - viewId: View标识
    - params: 查询变量值 Map<String, Set<String>>
end note

DPS -> DPS: retrieve(viewId, View)
DPS -> DPS: retrieve(sourceId, Source)

DPS -> DPS: parseVariables(view, param)
activate DPS #LightBlue

note right of DPS
    **变量解析顺序**
    1. 系统内置变量
    2. 组织级变量
    3. View级变量
end note

DPS -> DPS: getSysVariables()
note right
    注入系统变量:
    - DATART_USER_ID
    - DATART_USER_NAME
    - DATART_USER_USERNAME
    - DATART_USER_EMAIL
end note

DPS -> VS: listOrgValue(orgId)
activate VS
VS -> DB: SELECT org variables
VS -> VS: convertVariables()
note right
    权限变量:
    查询当前用户角色
    获取对应变量值
end note
VS --> DPS: List<VariableValue>
deactivate VS

DPS -> VS: listViewVarValuesByUser(userId, viewId)
activate VS
VS -> DB: SELECT view variables
VS --> DPS: List<VariableValue>
deactivate VS

loop 处理QUERY类型变量
    alt 参数中有传值
        DPS -> DPS: variable.setValues(params.get(name))
    else 没有传值但是表达式
        DPS -> DPS: variable.setValueType(FRAGMENT)
        note right: 表达式作为默认值直接输出
    end
end

deactivate DPS

alt 当前用户是组织Owner
    DPS -> DPS: disablePermissionVariables()
    note right: 禁用权限变量\n(Owner看所有数据)
end

DPS -> DPS: 构建QueryScript
note right
    QueryScript:
    - script: SQL脚本
    - variables: 变量列表
    - scriptType: SQL/STRUCT
end note

DPS -> SR: render(queryScript)
activate SR

== 变量替换流程 ==

SR -> SR: 解析SQL中的变量占位符
note right: 查找 $varName$ 模式

loop 每个变量占位符
    SR -> VP: new VariablePlaceholder(variables, sqlCall)
    activate VP
    
    VP -> VP: replacementPair()
    
    alt 权限变量 (PERMISSION)
        VP -> VP: replacePermissionVariable()
        
        alt 变量不存在
            VP --> SR: "1=1" (忽略条件)
        else 变量值为空
            VP --> SR: "1=0" (拒绝所有)
        else 变量被禁用(Owner)
            VP --> SR: "1=1"
        else 单值
            VP -> VP: replaceVariable()
            VP --> SR: 替换后的SQL片段
        else 多值
            VP -> VP: autoFixSqlCall()
            note right
                = → IN(...)
                != → NOT IN(...)
                > → MIN(values)
                < → MAX(values)
                LIKE → OR连接
            end note
            VP --> SR: 优化后的SQL片段
        end
        
    else 查询变量 (QUERY)
        VP -> VP: replaceQueryVariable()
        
        alt 变量值为空
            VP --> SR: "IS NULL" 条件
        else 多值+逻辑表达式
            VP -> VP: autoFixSqlCall()
            VP --> SR: 优化后的SQL片段
        else 其它情况
            VP -> VP: replaceVariable()
            VP --> SR: 替换后的SQL片段
        end
    end
    
    deactivate VP
end

SR -> SR: 组装最终SQL

SR --> DPS: 最终SQL语句
deactivate SR

DPS -> DB: 执行SQL
DB --> DPS: ResultSet

DPS -> DPS: 构建Dataframe

DPS --> User: Dataframe结果
deactivate DPS

== 权限变量值配置流程 ==

User -> VC: 配置角色权限变量值
activate VC

VC -> VS: updateRels(VariableRelUpdateParam)
activate VS

note over VS
    VariableRelUpdateParam:
    - relToCreate: 新增关系
    - relToUpdate: 更新关系
    - relToDelete: 删除关系
end note

alt 有新增
    VS -> DB: INSERT rel_variable_subject
end

alt 有更新
    VS -> DB: UPDATE rel_variable_subject
end

alt 有删除
    VS -> DB: DELETE rel_variable_subject
end

VS --> VC: success
deactivate VS

VC --> User: 配置成功
deactivate VC

@enduml

